The '''Imperial Planetary Occupation Facility''', or simply referred to as the '''I.P.O.F.''', was a huge, ready-made headquarters that was delivered to [[planet]]s recently subjugated and occupied by the [[Galactic Empire]]. Once the I.P.O.F. was deposited on a planet's surface, it rarely moved. The [[Imperial Complex (Lothal)|Imperial Complex]] on the planet [[Lothal]] was an I.P.O.F. It was taken out when [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] forces launched it into [[atmosphere]] and triggered a massive explosion to destroy it.<ref name="Databank" />

